; --- Bass eighth-note patterns (one bar each) ---
!bA a8 a8 >a8< a8 a8 >a8< a8 >a8<
!bF f8 f8 >f8< f8 f8 >f8< f8 >f8<
!bG g8 g8 >g8< g8 g8 >g8< g8 >g8<
!bE e8 e8 >e8< e8 e8 >e8< e8 >e8<

; --- Arpeggio figures (half a bar each; call twice per bar) ---
!arAm a16 c16 e16 >a16< e16 c16 a16 c16
!arF f16 a16 >c16 f16< c16 a16 f16 a16
!arG g16 b16 >d16 g16< d16 b16 g16 b16
!arE e16 g+16 >b16 e16< b16 g+16 e16 g+16

; --- Drum patterns ---
