  ; intro: Am Am F G
  !arAm !arAm !arAm !arAm !arF !arF !arG !arG
  ; A: Am Am F G Am Am F E
  !arAm !arAm !arAm !arAm !arF !arF !arG !arG
  !arAm !arAm !arAm !arAm !arF !arF !arE !arE
  ; B: F G Am Am F G Am E
